==Trivia==
*Pop-pop Wonderland's Japanese name, Pachi Pachi Wonderland, may be a reference to the candy [https://japanese-products.blog/2021/05/06/pachi-pachi-panic/ Pachi Pachi Panic].
*Pop-pop Wonderland appears to have been designed specifically for [[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The Spectral Cat]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]] alongside [[Candy Paradise]]. The Spectral Cat gains Sage Slayer, improving her performance against [[Dogenstein]] and [[Doctor K.O.]], and her Strong Against, Slow and Weaken abilities target all enemies in the stage except Dogenstein, who is neither [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] nor [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]].

